  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Former Ursus underground fighter, joined Rhodes Island after the scene broke up. \nNow a guard who loves to show off her destructive prowess.",
        "zh": "前乌萨斯地下搏击手，所属组织分裂后加入罗德岛。\n现作为近卫干员，在最前线发挥她出色的破坏力。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 1%\nSurveillance is recommended for rare cases like this. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.14u/L \nMinor infection currently showing no sign of spreading.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】1%\n患者目前病程控制稳定。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.14u/L\n患有轻度矿石病感染，目前无扩散倾向。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A freeform fighter.\nShe's the simple, easily fulfilled eat-sleep-repeat type. \nShe enjoys dried fish and honey. So much so, that if offered a compensation package with only those two items, she would actually mull it over.",
        "zh": "自由自在的搏击手。\n单细胞生物，吃饱睡好就可以无忧无虑活下去的类型。\n非常喜欢吃鱼干和蜂蜜，即使工资全部换成这两样，也要犹豫好一会儿才会拒绝程度的喜欢。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Since her underground fighting circuit broke up and everyone involved went into hiding, Rhodes Island has had a hard time gathering records of her past. \nBeehunter doesn't remember her own childhood well. All she knows for certain is she's been making a living off underground fights since a very young age. \nHer ideals come from the underground fighting lifestyle: Live simply, be rude when you have to, solve problems with your fists, and live in the moment.",
        "zh": "由于猎蜂小姐过去所属的地下搏击组织如今已经分崩离析，组织的成员们也去向不明，因此罗德岛很难找到有关她过去的确切记录。\n猎蜂小姐自己对童年的记忆也不甚清晰，唯一确定的就是，她很小的时候就已经在那个地下搏击组织生活了。\n无论如何，她的价值观显然也是来自地下搏击生活的熏陶，简单粗暴，用拳头解决问题，不去考虑明天，享受当下的一分一秒。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "There are no rules in underground fights. Winning is all that matters. \nWhen fighting one-on-one, Beehunter can beat most opponents on talent alone. \nHowever, on the battlefield, we rarely have the luxury of a one-on-one fight. Certainly not one with no interference. In short, Beehunter's skillset is not well suited to Rhodes Island's work.",
        "zh": "自由搏击，尤其是地下自由搏击，对形式是没有规范要求的，无论使用什么技巧手段，胜者为王。\n如果是没有外界因素干扰的一对一，猎蜂小姐能够凭借她的天赋和技巧，和绝大多数干员战成至少平手。\n但是，在战场上，是不会出现没有外界因素干扰的情况，和一对一的情况的，更遑论二者兼有，也就是说，事实上，猎蜂小姐的特长在罗德岛反而得不到最好的发挥。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "But Rhodes Island doesn't turn down such talent due to combat capabilities alone. Beehunter's... simplicity left her drill instructor baffled during her onboarding. \nIn the end, we decided to focus on her strengths: Take her opponents one at a time and knock them down as fast as possible. \nShe quite likes this tactic because she doesn't need to think. Still, she does need to learn to observe the flow of battle.",
        "zh": "罗德岛当然不会仅仅因为不适合上战场这样的理由就放过一个人才，不过，就连杜宾教官，一开始也拿这个软硬不吃的单细胞生物没辙，不知道该如何下手调教。\n在经过多方尝试之后，最后，还是决定让猎蜂小姐将自己的特长发挥到极致：\n如果同一时间只能专注于一个人，那就用更短的时间去击倒对方。\n猎蜂小姐对于这个不用思考的方针也十分满意。不过与之相对的，她依然必须要学会观察战场，这对猎蜂小姐来说，依然是一个困难的课题。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
